# Pin the line endings of every signed text file, so that a fresh checkout on any platform
# (core.autocrlf=true or false) produces the same bytes.  verify_local_prune_rtl.py additionally
# hashes the canonical LF form, so the signature is verifiable even in a foreign working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
# Formal VCD witnesses are frozen evidence: git must never rewrite their bytes
# (no EOL normalisation).  The NP4B binding additionally folds CRLF/CR to LF, so
# even a historically rewritten tree verifies identically.
*.vcd -text -eol
*.wdb binary
*.dcp binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.pdf binary
*.xcf binary

# Third-party tool output is frozen byte-for-byte: the trailing blanks belong to Vivado/xsim
# report formatting, and rewriting them would falsify the evidence.  The PR gate runs
# `git diff --check`, so these generated paths opt out of whitespace linting only -- line
# endings, hashing and the manifest bindings are unaffected.
*.rpt -whitespace
vivado_np7_ooc_*_reports/** -whitespace
vivado_np7_xsim_reports/** -whitespace
artifacts/logs/np7_vivado_xsim.txt -whitespace
artifacts/logs/xpm_wrapper_real_xpm_vivado2024p2.txt -whitespace
# CP5a 板级原始证据由 Vivado/XSCT/PowerShell 生成；保留采集字节，避免 CRLF
# 规范化后使正式 SHA-256 在 Windows 工作树与干净克隆之间漂移。
artifacts/logs/b3_qat_cp5a_pl_replay_20260917/** -text -whitespace

# CP8 物理签核与四态实板记录是机器证据，必须保留采集时的原始字节。
artifacts/logs/b3_cp8_physical_pass_20260917_14e8e06/** -text -whitespace
artifacts/logs/b3_cp8_four_state_board_20260918_1714fc8/** -text -whitespace
